  "lineage_findings": [
    "_get_index_monthly obtains pro.index_monthly and returns its DataFrame without return scaling; pro is the direct ts.pro_api instance.",
    "preprocess_dataframe only formats dates, replaces NaN/infinity with null, and adds update_time; it does not scale pct_chg.",
    "IndexMonthly has an Optional[float] pct_chg declaration and no field validator that scales it; BaseDataModel float coercion uses pd.to_numeric without multiplication or division.",
    "The cached index_monthly interface document describes pct_chg as change rate without an explicit percent unit; its sample projection omits pct_chg and does not resolve the ambiguity.",
    "The original materializer pivots stored pct_chg and subtracts the stored values without scaling; the D103 Java numerical algorithm follows that behavior.",
    "The preserved D022 actual raw response contains hs300 June0.0178/July-0.0786 before its unconverted Java mapper; all18 numeric fields match corresponding current stored records bit for bit."
